{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY21VReDJJPsuTaATfZ6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\"statements\":[{\"statement_id\":\"S1\",\"role\":\"finding\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O171\",\"O172\"],\"text\":\"My rear tyre has gone flat three mornings running. It holds air every evening when I lock the bike up.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S2\",\"role\":\"diagnosis\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O173\"],\"text\":\"The shop found a thorn in the tyre casing that caused the repeated punctures.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S3\",\"role\":\"next_step\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O174\"],\"text\":\"Fit a new inner tube once the casing is clear.\"}],\"conclusion\":\"insufficient_evidence\"}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":657,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":507,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":294},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}